{"ID":"20240504170631-n5s8zm4","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504170631-n5s8zm4","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504170631-n5s8zm4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624104128-zjjvt97\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611125243-sjdx2ii\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624104128-zjjvt97\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"156肤青（推青）","updated":"20240624104131"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240624104128-zjjvt97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624104128-zjjvt97","updated":"20240624104131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"（缺）"}]},{"ID":"20240611125129-wkal4w0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125129-wkal4w0"}},{"ID":"20240611125232-8z7gx9a","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125232-8z7gx9a","updated":"20240611125232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肤青《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125232-y9lchlg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125232-y9lchlg","updated":"20240611125232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛平。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125232-tpa16k3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125232-tpa16k3","updated":"20240611125232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主蛊毒，及蛇菜肉诸毒，恶创。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125232-nzuwjsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125232-nzuwjsx","updated":"20240611125232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名推青，一名推石，生益州。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125232-lw7kmcz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125232-lw7kmcz","updated":"20240611125232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案陶宏景云：俗方及仙经，并无用此者，亦相与不复识。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125232-iip0dqn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125232-iip0dqn","updated":"20240611125232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"上玉石，中品一十四种，旧十六种，考铁落、铁，宜与铁精为一。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125255-a0mak70","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125255-a0mak70"}},{"ID":"20240611125256-l3plrbq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125256-l3plrbq","updated":"20240611125302"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肤青《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125256-rcyvgjs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125256-rcyvgjs","updated":"20240611125256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，无毒．不可久服，令人瘦．一名推青，一名推石．生益州．"}]},{"ID":"20240611125256-cxboqvl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125256-cxboqvl","updated":"20240611125256"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶肤青，味辛，平．主蛊毒及蛇菜肉诸毒，恶疮．生川谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240611125129-unxey3a","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125129-unxey3a"}},{"ID":"20240611125212-1frxl2b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125212-1frxl2b","updated":"20240611125220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肤青《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125212-3pemipr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125212-3pemipr","updated":"20240611125212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、咸，平，无毒。主治蛊毒、毒蛇、菜肉诸毒，恶疮。不可久服。令人瘦。一名推青，一名推石。生益州川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125212-3fas5ei","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125212-3fas5ei","updated":"20240611125212"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"世方及《仙经》并无用此者，亦相与不复识之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125130-748xupd","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125130-748xupd"}},{"ID":"20240611125131-iiq0dve","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125131-iiq0dve","updated":"20240611125154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肤青《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125131-z1bxb9g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125131-z1bxb9g","updated":"20240611125131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、咸，平，无毒。主蛊毒及蛇、菜、肉诸毒，恶疮。不可久服，令人瘦。一名推青，一名推石。生益州川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125131-b9amlpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125131-b9amlpm","updated":"20240611125131"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶俗方及《仙经》并无用此者，亦相与不复识。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125131-lke7b6u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125131-lke7b6u"}},{"ID":"20240611125137-h3sf5fo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125137-h3sf5fo","updated":"20240611125147"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肤青《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125137-iatckf7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125137-iatckf7","updated":"20240611125137"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛咸，平，无毒。主蛊毒，蛇菜肉诸毒，恶疮。不可久服，令人瘦。一名推青，一名推石，生益州川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125138-fpxn3o2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125138-fpxn3o2"}},{"ID":"20240611125200-4hohqxo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125200-4hohqxo","updated":"20240611125206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肤青《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125200-yrnntyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125200-yrnntyj","updated":"20240611125200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生益州。味辛、咸，平，无毒。主蛊毒及蛇菜肉诸毒，诸恶疮。不可久服，令人瘦。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125201-xnhq7ed","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125201-xnhq7ed"}},{"ID":"20240611125242-m6wvz6g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240611125242-m6wvz6g","updated":"20240611125247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肤青《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240611125242-bffl0w5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125242-bffl0w5","updated":"20240611125242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、咸，平，无毒。主蛊毒及蛇、菜肉诸毒，恶疮。不可久服，令人瘦。一名推青，一名推石。生益州川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125242-y2xyp62","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125242-y2xyp62","updated":"20240611125242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"俗方及《仙经》并无用此者，亦相与不复识之。"}]},{"ID":"20240611125242-ncmtj90","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240611125242-ncmtj90"}},{"ID":"20240611125243-sjdx2ii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240611125243-sjdx2ii"}}]}